es</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Simple</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Fast</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>More conflict misses</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Device sends interrupt request</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Software Priority</li><li class='leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300'>Priority determined by software instructions.</li></ul>",
